# builtin-lower takes a resolved+typechecked Document and returns a CoreDocument.
# Pipeline: parse -> desugar -> program-docs -> resolve -> typecheck-doc -> lower.
# Verifies that builtin-lower returns a value of type "CoreDocument" without error.
# Uses new env-dict protocol: builtin-resolve takes name-set, builtin-eval takes
# (lowered, env) and returns the exports Dict directly.
[call [fn [let]
  [src:     [builtin-str-bytes "[answer: 42]"]]
  [parsed:  [builtin-parse src "test.llt"]]
  [desug:   [builtin-desugar parsed.program]]
  [docs:    [builtin-program-docs desug]]
  [doc0:    [builtin-dict-get 0 docs]]
  [resolved: [builtin-resolve doc0 []]]
  [tc:      [builtin-make-type-ctx]]
  [typed:   [builtin-typecheck-doc resolved.doc tc]]
  [lowered: [builtin-lower typed.doc]]
  [builtin-eq-string [builtin-type-of lowered] "CoreDocument"]]]
=== out
Int(1)
